---
// Gallery — heading with a six-image mosaic grid and caption overlays.
---

<section class="bg-bg py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400">Inside Halcyon</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-fg sm:text-5xl">Designed to feel like a deep breath</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">Every colour, curve and transition in the product is tuned to lower the temperature of a busy day.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 grid auto-rows-[180px] grid-cols-2 gap-4 sm:auto-rows-[220px] md:grid-cols-4">
      <figure class="group relative col-span-2 row-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line">
        <img src="/media/abstract-1.svg" alt="Flowing violet and coral gradient artwork" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950/80 to-transparent p-6 pt-16">
          <p class="font-display text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white">The Week view</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/80">Five days, one screen, nothing extra.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="group relative col-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line">
        <img src="/media/abstract-2.svg" alt="Soft blended gradient artwork in cool tones" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950/80 to-transparent p-5 pt-14">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white">Focus mode</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/80">One task, full attention.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line">
        <img src="/media/abstract-3.svg" alt="Abstract gradient artwork with layered shapes" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950/80 to-transparent p-5 pt-14">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white">Morning digest</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line">
        <img src="/media/abstract-4.svg" alt="Warm abstract gradient artwork" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950/80 to-transparent p-5 pt-14">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white">Quiet hours</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="group relative col-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line">
        <img src="/media/abstract-5.svg" alt="Colourful abstract gradient artwork with sweeping curves" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950/80 to-transparent p-5 pt-14">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white">Timelines</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/80">See the quarter without squinting.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="group relative col-span-2 overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-line">
        <img src="/media/abstract-6.svg" alt="Abstract gradient artwork in deep, restful colours" class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover transition duration-500 group-hover:scale-105" loading="lazy" />
        <figcaption class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-950/80 to-transparent p-5 pt-14">
          <p class="font-display text-lg font-medium tracking-tight text-white">Friday wrap-up</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/80">A gentle summary of what shipped.</p>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
